WEBVTT

00:00:25.740 --> 00:00:29.040
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:34.280
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:39.120
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.120 --> 00:00:43.620
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.190 --> 00:00:46.990
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.990 --> 00:00:51.560
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.830 --> 00:00:56.600
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.600 --> 00:00:59.270
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.270 --> 00:01:01.470
Give thanks!

00:01:01.470 --> 00:01:04.680
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.110 --> 00:01:10.480
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.480 --> 00:01:15.620
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.620 --> 00:01:20.890
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.160 --> 00:01:25.060
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:25.060 --> 00:01:31.140
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.140 --> 00:01:33.940
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.940 --> 00:01:36.510
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.510 --> 00:01:39.110
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.110 --> 00:01:43.380
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:48.450 --> 00:01:50.460
Someone once said...

00:01:51.520 --> 00:01:55.630
There is wonderfully crunchy 
thin mochi that moves through

00:01:55.630 --> 00:01:59.260
an exquisite sea of soy 
sauce like flying fish...

00:01:59.260 --> 00:02:02.370
Flying Mochi!

00:02:09.170 --> 00:02:14.610
There are refreshing sweet and 
sour kumquats like gold dust...

00:02:15.150 --> 00:02:18.350
Gold Kumquat Dust!

00:02:20.120 --> 00:02:22.950
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:24.020 --> 00:02:30.360
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:32.430 --> 00:02:36.300
Toriko and Komatsu went off to visit 
Melk in order to search for information

00:02:36.300 --> 00:02:40.810
about Melk Stardust and to have 
Melk make a new knife for Komatsu.

00:02:41.410 --> 00:02:44.740
Komatsu was moved by what 
he saw in the workshop.

00:02:46.140 --> 00:02:49.710
However, Toriko was suspicious 
of Melk's identity.

00:02:50.480 --> 00:02:54.820
Melk's pride wounded, the enraged 
cutler challenged Toriko to a battle.

00:02:55.750 --> 00:03:00.020
Who the hell are you? Where's the real Melk?

00:03:00.930 --> 00:03:02.030
I'm the second generation!

00:03:03.160 --> 00:03:05.260
I'm Cutler Melk the Second!

00:03:06.300 --> 00:03:09.530
Six years ago, the original Melk headed out

00:03:09.530 --> 00:03:14.110
to mine for the extremely rare 
Melk Stardust and never came back.

00:03:14.840 --> 00:03:17.310
Toriko made a vow to find Melk Stardust

00:03:17.310 --> 00:03:20.280
and bring back the 
first-generation Melk alive.

00:03:21.750 --> 00:03:25.080
And so, Toriko has arrived at the 
deep and dangerous underground cave

00:03:25.080 --> 00:03:27.390
known as Heavy Hole!

00:03:29.820 --> 00:03:33.830
Supergravity! Conquer Heavy Hole!

00:03:38.530 --> 00:03:39.130
Toriko...

00:03:40.900 --> 00:03:42.770
Will he really be alright alone?

00:03:43.600 --> 00:03:47.170
Heavy Hole is one of the most 
dangerous places in the Human World.

00:03:48.040 --> 00:03:50.980
Even the Beasts' average Capture 
Level there exceeds 50.

00:03:51.840 --> 00:03:53.650
It'll be okay, Melk-san!

00:03:54.110 --> 00:03:55.750
Toriko-san is really strong!

00:04:03.690 --> 00:04:07.960
Vampire Kong (Mammalian 
Beast) Capture Level 30

00:04:11.230 --> 00:04:12.130
Stop it, Pochiko!

00:04:16.270 --> 00:04:17.470
He's a guest.

00:04:19.100 --> 00:04:22.670
Gave you quite a surprise, huh? 
This is my pet Vampire Kong.

00:04:22.670 --> 00:04:23.710
Her name's Pochiko.

00:04:25.040 --> 00:04:26.880
P-Pochiko?

00:04:26.880 --> 00:04:29.850
Pochiko was originally my master's pet.

00:04:29.850 --> 00:04:32.480
She's intelligent enough 
to deliver knives for me.

00:04:32.920 --> 00:04:35.820
D-Deliver knives?

00:04:36.450 --> 00:04:40.530
In fact, she brings most of the knives 
I make to their intended owners.

00:04:40.530 --> 00:04:41.990
Oh, really?

00:04:43.290 --> 00:04:45.700
Welcome back, Pochiko. Good girl.

00:04:54.210 --> 00:04:56.170
That tree is her nest?

00:04:56.710 --> 00:05:00.380
She has the face of a bat, but she 
doesn't hang upside down, huh?

00:05:00.380 --> 00:05:02.380
What a majestic upright stance.

00:05:02.850 --> 00:05:05.550
Well, time to get to work! As usual, 
there are a lot of orders to fill today!

00:05:06.250 --> 00:05:08.520
Right! Let's get to sharpening, Melk-san!

00:05:19.130 --> 00:05:20.500
Sure have come down a long way...

00:05:21.300 --> 00:05:24.040
...but it looks like I'm not 
even close to the lowest level

00:05:24.040 --> 00:05:25.870
where the first Melk is.

00:05:25.870 --> 00:05:27.910
I'm still annoyed with Komatsu...

00:05:29.910 --> 00:05:32.580
Toriko-san, please go by yourself.

00:05:32.580 --> 00:05:34.250
A dangerous place like that...

00:05:34.550 --> 00:05:38.350
Why?! What do you think we 
came here together for?!

00:05:38.350 --> 00:05:39.920
I know, but...

00:05:39.920 --> 00:05:43.020
I told you, remember?! I need your strength!

00:05:43.020 --> 00:05:45.690
There's no point if we 
don't conquer it together!

00:05:45.690 --> 00:05:47.660
What do you think, Melk-san?

00:05:47.760 --> 00:05:52.530
Hmm, it's probably too dangerous, 
even for Chef Komatsu...

00:05:52.530 --> 00:05:54.470
I know, right?!

00:05:54.470 --> 00:05:55.600
Don't tell me...

00:05:55.600 --> 00:05:59.370
You just wanna stay behind 
so you can watch Melk work?

00:05:59.370 --> 00:06:05.210
N-No... I-It's... It's not...

00:06:06.180 --> 00:06:08.650
I understand perfectly.

00:06:09.580 --> 00:06:10.850
Alright...

00:06:10.850 --> 00:06:13.720
Let me borrow one of your knives.

00:06:14.250 --> 00:06:15.020
A knife?

00:06:15.020 --> 00:06:18.990
Yeah. You were using that 
small one before, right?

00:06:18.990 --> 00:06:22.830
You could say knives are your life, 
so I'm gonna bring one along.

00:06:23.030 --> 00:06:24.860
W-Why...?

00:06:26.600 --> 00:06:30.070
As collateral. If something 
should happen to me...

00:06:30.600 --> 00:06:33.740
...something you value as much as 
your life will share the same fate.

00:06:34.740 --> 00:06:36.240
What's that?!

00:06:36.240 --> 00:06:39.380
Just kidding! We're partners, aren't we?

00:06:39.380 --> 00:06:42.280
That means wherever we go, 
our hearts are always one!

00:06:42.780 --> 00:06:45.780
Besides, this will be a 
good division of labor.

00:06:45.780 --> 00:06:47.320
I just realized that.

00:06:48.220 --> 00:06:51.590
Komatsu, you've got more 
important work to do.

00:06:52.620 --> 00:06:54.590
Important work?

00:06:59.800 --> 00:07:01.330
Still...

00:07:01.330 --> 00:07:03.170
He always jumps at the chance to see

00:07:03.170 --> 00:07:05.770
rare ingredients in their 
native environment...

00:07:06.200 --> 00:07:08.940
Guess it just goes to show how 
interested he is in Melk's work...

00:07:09.640 --> 00:07:12.510
Well, I'm sure Melk prefers it this way, too.

00:07:12.510 --> 00:07:15.780
This time, my partner is this knife...

00:07:16.680 --> 00:07:17.780
Alright, now...

00:07:17.780 --> 00:07:20.950
If Komatsu was here in this Heavy 
Hole with his power of observation,

00:07:20.950 --> 00:07:23.120
where would he suggest 
we go ever so carefully?

00:07:23.120 --> 00:07:25.790
He can hear the voices of 
ingredients, so naturally,

00:07:25.790 --> 00:07:27.690
he and I see the lay of the land differently.

00:07:28.560 --> 00:07:32.430
And it's only natural for the 
weak to proceed with caution.

00:07:32.430 --> 00:07:35.200
So maybe I'll go ahead as 
if Komatsu <i>was</i> by my side...

00:07:44.110 --> 00:07:46.510
These are all kitchen knives?

00:07:46.510 --> 00:07:51.680
That's right. Chefs from all over the 
world sent them to me to be sharpened.

00:07:52.280 --> 00:07:54.650
I guess I get around 100 knives a day.

00:07:55.550 --> 00:07:56.450
100 knives?!

00:07:58.160 --> 00:08:01.460
Now I know why you said it would 
take three years to get to mine...

00:08:02.690 --> 00:08:05.530
I can usually tell who the owner 
is just by looking at the knife.

00:08:07.130 --> 00:08:08.130
Really?!

00:08:08.730 --> 00:08:11.200
C-Can I touch one?

00:08:11.200 --> 00:08:11.900
Just be careful.

00:08:13.940 --> 00:08:20.010
F-For example, who the heck owns 
this richly gleaming knife?

00:08:20.210 --> 00:08:22.810
Lulubu, the chef at Guts, uses that one.

00:08:22.980 --> 00:08:25.420
G-G-G-Guts?!

00:08:25.420 --> 00:08:28.120
Guts, the seven-star restaurant 
on the 312th floor,

00:08:28.120 --> 00:08:30.220
the top floor of the Gourmet Tower?!

00:08:30.220 --> 00:08:33.730
This is the knife that 
owner-chef Mr. Lulubu uses?!

00:08:35.190 --> 00:08:37.100
It's awe-inspiring...

00:08:37.100 --> 00:08:40.230
I'm holding the knife of a 
charismatic chef like that...

00:08:40.230 --> 00:08:43.230
Incidentally, this knife 
belongs to Mr. Yuji at Mogura.

00:08:44.670 --> 00:08:48.670
Mogura, the eight-star hormone-yaki 
restaurant in Gourmet Alley?!

00:08:48.670 --> 00:08:51.640
That knife is the manager's, Mr. Yuji?!

00:08:52.280 --> 00:08:55.710
A-All of these knives belong 
to super-famous people!

00:08:55.710 --> 00:08:57.650
That says a lot about your 
sharpening, Melk-san.

00:08:57.650 --> 00:09:00.180
Everyone trusts you completely!

00:09:01.890 --> 00:09:04.160
Most of them were regular 
customers of the first Melk.

00:09:05.720 --> 00:09:08.730
It's because my master 
only ever saw the knives.

00:09:09.330 --> 00:09:11.400
He didn't know where they came from...

00:09:11.860 --> 00:09:14.270
And I don't think he particularly cared.

00:09:15.300 --> 00:09:17.240
But to be honest, I'm curious myself.

00:09:17.900 --> 00:09:21.370
I wonder what kind of chef uses 
a magnificent knife like this...

00:09:22.770 --> 00:09:25.710
That's what I thought when I saw 
your broken knife, Chef Komatsu.

00:09:27.450 --> 00:09:30.320
I asked myself, "Just what kind 
of person is this Chef Komatsu,

00:09:30.320 --> 00:09:32.080
who puts so much love into using this knife?"

00:09:39.320 --> 00:09:43.430
Maybe my curiosity about the knives' owners 
is a sign that I lack concentration.

00:09:44.260 --> 00:09:47.530
Compared to the first Melk, 
perhaps I'm still a novice...

00:09:47.900 --> 00:09:50.740
Th-That's not true!

00:09:50.740 --> 00:09:54.510
You're right, kitchen knives reflect 
the traits of the people who use them!

00:09:54.910 --> 00:09:59.040
All my master had on his 
mind was making good knives.

00:09:59.540 --> 00:10:02.580
Th-That is a beautiful knife...

00:10:02.580 --> 00:10:05.780
I don't think it even 
needs much sharpening...

00:10:06.420 --> 00:10:10.220
This is a sashimi knife used by the 
chef at the famous restaurant, Gyoki.

00:10:11.060 --> 00:10:14.230
It's a shop that uses a lot of delicate, 
Special Preparation ingredients.

00:10:15.330 --> 00:10:17.360
Just one-thousandth of a millimeter of damage

00:10:17.360 --> 00:10:19.030
has a major effect on the preparations.

00:10:20.930 --> 00:10:23.400
From a crack I can't even see...

00:10:23.400 --> 00:10:25.800
First-rate chefs don't need their 
eyes. They can tell if there's damage

00:10:25.800 --> 00:10:29.040
by the way it feels when 
they're chopping ingredients.

00:10:29.610 --> 00:10:30.540
It's the same with cutlers...

00:10:32.280 --> 00:10:35.180
We don't use our eyes, but 
sharpen by sound and sensation.

00:10:36.010 --> 00:10:40.250
I-Incredible... It's like 
Melk-san is glowing...

00:10:47.990 --> 00:10:49.890
The scraping sound came after!

00:10:51.700 --> 00:10:52.100
Good.

00:10:54.270 --> 00:10:55.330
All that sweat...

00:10:56.770 --> 00:11:01.270
I-I'm the same way... When I'm concentrating 
on cooking something complicated,

00:11:01.270 --> 00:11:03.010
I'll find myself dripping with sweat...

00:11:04.340 --> 00:11:07.310
Sweat running off like a waterfall...

00:11:07.310 --> 00:11:11.220
For just that one scrape, every nerve 
in Melk's body must have focused.

00:11:11.650 --> 00:11:13.020
Alright... Finished...

00:11:14.720 --> 00:11:18.020
If it had been my master, 
he would've sharpened this

00:11:18.020 --> 00:11:19.320
without dripping one bead of sweat...

00:11:21.960 --> 00:11:25.730
Th-That gave me goosebumps! 
It was amazing! Moving!

00:11:26.500 --> 00:11:27.300
Really?

00:11:27.570 --> 00:11:29.900
I was just able to see the 
greatest sharpening in the world!

00:11:29.900 --> 00:11:32.070
I feel like I'm on cloud nine!

00:11:34.540 --> 00:11:35.240
Thank you.

00:11:35.810 --> 00:11:38.940
Actually, you did it with 
such lightning speed

00:11:38.940 --> 00:11:42.180
that I couldn't see what happened at all...

00:11:44.680 --> 00:11:47.320
The sharpening speed depends on 
the knife's quality and purpose,

00:11:47.320 --> 00:11:49.290
as well as the type of grindstone.

00:11:49.290 --> 00:11:51.820
It also varies according to the user's style.

00:11:51.820 --> 00:11:54.660
I'd love to see you sharpen one slowly!

00:11:54.790 --> 00:11:56.030
Sure, why not?

00:12:01.470 --> 00:12:04.000
I've got goosebumps all over!

00:12:04.000 --> 00:12:05.440
Could you keep it down a little?

00:12:06.340 --> 00:12:07.270
Sorry...

00:12:14.750 --> 00:12:16.550
Yeah... This is it.

00:12:17.120 --> 00:12:20.450
It's not as bad as in the Gourmet World, 
but my body's gotten a lot heavier.

00:12:21.390 --> 00:12:24.420
I must've descended about 10,000 meters...

00:12:24.420 --> 00:12:26.860
...but getting down is harder 
than I thought it'd be.

00:12:27.330 --> 00:12:30.660
It may actually be tougher than 
climbing the same distance...

00:12:31.160 --> 00:12:32.060
Not only that...

00:12:32.660 --> 00:12:36.230
There's a clear scent of Beasts in the 
air, coming from all these holes...

00:12:38.670 --> 00:12:40.470
Something's coming!

00:12:43.370 --> 00:12:44.780
Interesting.

00:12:44.780 --> 00:12:48.150
In the Gourmet World, I didn't know 
what was going on and panicked...

00:12:48.150 --> 00:12:49.550
...but now it's different!

00:12:50.210 --> 00:12:52.880
Whether you're a demon or snake, 
come out from wherever you are

00:12:52.880 --> 00:12:54.020
and take a crack at me!

00:13:45.870 --> 00:13:47.970
They're serious about trying to eat me!

00:13:50.170 --> 00:13:51.180
Here they come!

00:13:54.050 --> 00:13:55.750
The idea was to dodge it, but...

00:13:58.050 --> 00:14:03.520
I see... With the stronger gravity, 
my body responds slower than usual!

00:14:07.990 --> 00:14:09.730
I've got to move one step quicker...

00:14:10.530 --> 00:14:13.060
...and give my body orders 
faster than normal.

00:14:17.240 --> 00:14:20.070
When it comes to pure speed, 
the Beasts that live here

00:14:20.070 --> 00:14:23.110
are dozens of times faster than me.

00:14:23.540 --> 00:14:26.210
There's no time to watch their 
movements and then react...

00:14:26.210 --> 00:14:29.080
As much as I can, I'll predict 
their trajectory, then move first!

00:14:29.950 --> 00:14:32.750
Their forms... The contraction 
of their muscles...

00:14:33.420 --> 00:14:35.450
The movement of their 
joints... Their breathing...

00:14:35.920 --> 00:14:38.760
With all of that information, 
I'll predict their next move!

00:14:39.890 --> 00:14:42.930
Right or left! Up or down!

00:14:46.700 --> 00:14:47.200
Right!

00:15:00.010 --> 00:15:02.550
There we go! I'm gettin' used to this!

00:15:02.550 --> 00:15:07.690
It feels like my weight right now is 
about double, maybe 460 kilograms...

00:15:08.950 --> 00:15:12.190
Compared to the Gourmet 
World, this is a piece of...

00:15:15.360 --> 00:15:17.030
There's no gettin' around this!

00:15:17.560 --> 00:15:19.260
They're using numbers to fill the gaps!

00:15:20.930 --> 00:15:21.870
Interesting...

00:15:22.570 --> 00:15:24.900
In the Gourmet World, I 
didn't even think about it

00:15:24.900 --> 00:15:26.740
'til I got beaten black and blue...

00:15:27.540 --> 00:15:29.370
Protecting myself...

00:15:29.370 --> 00:15:32.610
The importance of defense when 
fighting a formidable enemy...

00:15:32.610 --> 00:15:34.010
Think I'll test it out...

00:15:34.610 --> 00:15:38.350
Using my Fork, which I've always 
attacked with... for defense!

00:15:41.920 --> 00:15:43.920
Fork Shield!

00:15:50.700 --> 00:15:52.960
Alright. I managed to protect myself.

00:15:53.730 --> 00:15:55.600
The only thing is, it'll take a lot of power

00:15:55.600 --> 00:15:59.740
to keep generating such a huge, tough Fork.

00:15:59.740 --> 00:16:02.170
I won't be able to make one after another.

00:16:02.170 --> 00:16:04.510
And of course, right now, I can 
only protect myself up close.

00:16:05.210 --> 00:16:06.980
Spiked Punch!

00:16:10.750 --> 00:16:12.650
Hold on, first-generation Melk!

00:16:12.850 --> 00:16:13.820
I'm on my way!

00:16:22.830 --> 00:16:24.130
Good morning.

00:16:24.600 --> 00:16:26.760
Morning, Chef Komatsu. 
Were you able to sleep?

00:16:27.170 --> 00:16:29.900
Not really. I was excited all day yesterday,

00:16:29.900 --> 00:16:31.500
so I just couldn't make myself nod off...

00:16:31.970 --> 00:16:34.110
You stayed up all night working, didn't you?

00:16:34.110 --> 00:16:36.310
I kept thinking about it...

00:16:36.310 --> 00:16:38.810
I have so many requests that 
there isn't time to sleep.

00:16:40.110 --> 00:16:43.180
I mean... you get all that in just one day...

00:16:43.180 --> 00:16:44.980
I'm making soup. Want some?

00:16:46.550 --> 00:16:47.420
Sure!

00:16:59.430 --> 00:17:00.600
Here you are.

00:17:00.600 --> 00:17:01.800
Thank you.

00:17:05.800 --> 00:17:07.510
It's delicious!

00:17:07.840 --> 00:17:11.240
It's refined and has a light flavor, yet 
it's a deep-bodied traditional soup!

00:17:11.380 --> 00:17:14.180
The faint sake-cake flavor 
gives it a nice bite.

00:17:15.380 --> 00:17:19.380
I bet you used Sake-Cake Snapping 
Turtle for the broth, didn't you?

00:17:19.720 --> 00:17:21.320
You're some chef...

00:17:21.320 --> 00:17:24.360
Guessing the soup stock ingredient 
right from just one spoonful...

00:17:24.360 --> 00:17:27.360
Well, you're really good 
at cooking, Melk-san.

00:17:27.360 --> 00:17:31.630
I guess people who have good sense 
are good at whatever they do...

00:17:31.630 --> 00:17:32.430
Thank you.

00:17:33.560 --> 00:17:36.630
Alright, time for work! There's 
plenty to do today, too!

00:17:36.630 --> 00:17:37.070
Right!

00:17:44.880 --> 00:17:49.750
So you start making kitchen knives 
from the forging stage, huh, Melk-san?

00:17:49.750 --> 00:17:53.950
No. Really, the work is supposed to 
start with procuring the materials.

00:17:57.490 --> 00:18:01.090
But I'm not able to get materials 
that have high capture levels.

00:18:01.730 --> 00:18:03.960
My master used to do everything himself.

00:18:04.800 --> 00:18:06.700
That means I've still got a long way to go...

00:18:08.870 --> 00:18:11.970
This tempering stage is extremely 
important for kitchen knives.

00:18:11.970 --> 00:18:14.940
It's ridiculous to say you've 
got "a long way to go"

00:18:14.940 --> 00:18:17.240
when you can make a 
beautiful knife like this.

00:18:17.240 --> 00:18:19.380
I don't know about that. But thank you.

00:18:21.350 --> 00:18:25.050
Normally, to sharpen cutlery step by step,

00:18:25.050 --> 00:18:26.950
you use three different types of grindstones:

00:18:26.950 --> 00:18:30.120
A rough grindstone, a medium-grade millstone,

00:18:30.120 --> 00:18:33.890
and a finer-grained "finishing 
grindstone" for the final touches.

00:18:33.890 --> 00:18:37.000
But this Gradastone naturally 
has all of the gradations.

00:18:37.560 --> 00:18:39.930
With this one stone, you can 
accomplish all of the stages,

00:18:39.930 --> 00:18:41.830
using it as a rough grindstone 
to a finishing grindstone.

00:18:42.070 --> 00:18:46.270
Huh. Imagine, a miraculous grindstone 
like that occurs in nature...

00:18:46.940 --> 00:18:49.640
My master is the one who 
first discovered this, too...

00:18:50.070 --> 00:18:58.080
Th-That doesn't matter. You're the one 
who's perfectly mastered it, Melk-san.

00:18:58.080 --> 00:19:02.720
Not yet, I haven't... I don't even 
come close to the first Melk's skills.

00:19:11.700 --> 00:19:14.670
Anyway, I hope Toriko is okay.

00:19:14.670 --> 00:19:18.000
Let's have some faith! Toriko-san 
is really strong, you know.

00:19:18.370 --> 00:19:23.170
I'm sure he'll come back with both 
Melk Stardust and the first Melk-san!

00:19:31.880 --> 00:19:33.620
W-What's this?!

00:19:33.620 --> 00:19:36.120
Oh. It's just what it looks 
like, an open-air bath.

00:19:37.160 --> 00:19:38.220
It's a real hot spring.

00:19:38.660 --> 00:19:40.860
H-Hot spring?!

00:19:40.860 --> 00:19:41.890
You can go in if you'd like...

00:19:42.830 --> 00:19:43.760
Are you sure?!

00:19:44.030 --> 00:19:44.660
Of course!

00:19:45.460 --> 00:19:48.270
I'm told that my master dug 
it out when he was young.

00:19:49.030 --> 00:19:50.940
Can you believe it, in this rocky mountain?

00:19:51.300 --> 00:19:54.240
My master is a one of a 
kind... I mean, he's amazing!

00:19:54.610 --> 00:19:57.440
S-So he made it himself...

00:20:01.780 --> 00:20:03.410
It feels great!

00:20:04.180 --> 00:20:06.820
I have to tell Toriko-san about this!

00:20:07.490 --> 00:20:12.390
Anyway, Melk-san sure does put the 
original Melk-san up on a pedestal...

00:20:12.390 --> 00:20:15.630
In fact, he puts himself down a lot,

00:20:16.230 --> 00:20:18.400
even though he's the greatest 
cutler in the world...

00:20:18.400 --> 00:20:19.400
I wonder why...

00:20:24.370 --> 00:20:26.070
The gravity's increasing even more!

00:20:27.610 --> 00:20:29.270
Fork Shield!

00:20:39.620 --> 00:20:41.920
Spiked Punch!

00:20:46.360 --> 00:20:47.330
Running out of strength...

00:22:08.010 --> 00:22:08.910
Dishing with Tina!

00:22:10.110 --> 00:22:12.380
It's "Dishing with Tina", the talk 
show with a heaping helping of fun!

00:22:13.210 --> 00:22:17.150
Our guest today is Johannes-san, 
an employee of IGO!

00:22:17.880 --> 00:22:18.950
I'm Johannes.

00:22:18.950 --> 00:22:19.850
This is gonna be tough...

00:22:20.520 --> 00:22:25.190
Okay, we'll see what makes our 
guest tick with this yes/no quiz!

00:22:25.190 --> 00:22:26.790
Please answer yes or no.

00:22:27.160 --> 00:22:30.330
First question. Are you busy working at IGO?

00:22:31.730 --> 00:22:33.730
I cannot answer that.

00:22:34.800 --> 00:22:35.870
Why not?

00:22:35.870 --> 00:22:36.900
I'm bound to secrecy.

00:22:37.400 --> 00:22:39.640
Seriously? This is a heaping 
helping of hard to work with...

00:22:40.140 --> 00:22:42.170
Well, do you have a lot of interests, 
which would surprise me?

00:22:43.140 --> 00:22:45.040
I cannot answer that either.

00:22:45.040 --> 00:22:47.080
Do you prefer Western food to Eastern food?

00:22:47.880 --> 00:22:49.650
I cannot answer that either.

00:22:51.480 --> 00:22:52.650
What's your name?!

00:22:55.820 --> 00:22:58.090
I cannot answer that either.

00:22:58.090 --> 00:23:00.260
Can't you answer anything?!

00:23:00.260 --> 00:23:02.090
In fact, you gave your name at the start!

00:23:02.090 --> 00:23:03.060
Oh, just forget it!

00:23:03.060 --> 00:23:04.430
On to the next segment...

00:23:07.160 --> 00:23:08.320
Melk's shocking confession.

00:23:08.320 --> 00:23:10.690
The astonishing truth is revealed.

00:23:10.790 --> 00:23:13.900
Let your ears hear the cry of a soul!

00:23:14.270 --> 00:23:16.990
Hidden Truth! the First Melk Appears!

00:23:17.530 --> 00:23:19.480
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
